# Story page: stick
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = The Popsicle Stick
---
Licked perfectly clean, which took more courage than I possess. A joke is printed on it: 'What is a snake's favorite dessert? You.'

It is not a good joke. It is, in fact, a threat wearing a joke's clothing, which is the most common disguise that threats wear.

Burned faintly into the wood is a ring of scales, closed like a circle. I pretended not to see it, and then I saw it for several more pages.
